<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>Coffee Brando</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            font-family: Arial;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: white;
            background-color: brown;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: brown;
        }

        a {
            color: brown;
            margin: 10px;
        }

        img {
            margin: 10px;
        }

        table {
            background-color: white;
        }

        th {
            background-color: brown;
            color: white;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 8px;
        }

        input, select {
            padding: 5px;
        }

        input[type="submit"] {
            background-color: brown;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Coffee Brando</h1>

    <p>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#order">Order</a>
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2 id="about">About Coffee Brando</h2>

    <p>Welcome to Coffee Brando! We sell different kinds of coffee.</p>

    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.IlZXoeDEBPrtSPCKssrxIgHaEJ?w=272&h=180&c=7&r=0&o=7&pid=1.7&rm=3" width="250">

    <p>This is our coffee mug.</p>

    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.LJczYoiz0zkw8AgHPh1Y7wHaHa?w=187&h=187&c=7&r=0&o=7&pid=1.7&rm=3" width="250">

    <p>Our available coffees:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>Americano</li>
        <li>Iced coffee</li>
        <li>Espresso</li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <h2>Coffee Prices</h2>

    <table border="5">

        <tr>
            <th>Drink</th>
            <th>Price</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Americano</td>
            <td>₱100</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Iced Coffee</td>
            <td>₱80</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Espresso</td>
            <td>₱40-50</td>
        </tr>

    </table>

    <hr>

    <h2 id="order">Order Coffee</h2>

    <form>

        <p>
            Name:
            <input type="text">
        </p>

        <p>
            Email:
            <input type="email">
        </p>

        <p>
            Drink:
            <select>
                <option>Americano</option>
                <option>Iced Coffee</option>
                <option>Espresso</option>
            </select>
        </p>

        <p>
            <input type="radio" name="size"> Small
            <input type="radio" name="size"> Large
        </p>

        <input type="submit" value="Order">

    </form>

    <hr>

    <p>&copy; Coffee Brando</p>

</body>

</html>
